VIWGS contains source files under different upstream licenses.

Repository-original integration changes, build scripts and documentation are
provided under GPL-3.0-or-later (licenses/GPL-3.0.txt). This grant does not
relicense third-party sources or override inherited terms.

- VIW-Fusion/VINS-Fusion-derived frontend files and GPL-marked Photo-SLAM files:
  see licenses/GPL-3.0.txt and the notices in each file.
- Gaussian Splatting-derived mapping, rasterization and simple-knn files:
  see licenses/Gaussian-Splatting.md (research/evaluation and non-commercial restrictions).
- Dear ImGui: src/gaussian_mapping/src/viewer/imgui/LICENSE.txt.
- tinyply: the public-domain dedication and fallback permission in its file headers.

The original copyright and license notices remain authoritative for each file.
This notice does not grant a new license over third-party work or resolve the
compatibility of the combined GPL and Gaussian Splatting components.
See THIRD_PARTY.md for provenance and the outstanding combined-distribution issue.
